Project Title: api_weather_and_location.py
Description: Using API to retrieve weather in Celisus, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin with location in latitude and longitude. Also
provides details on temperature feel, temperature min/max, pressure, and humidity.
Requirements: Must have API key from http://api.openweathermap.org and review requirements if wanting to create/modify API.
Must also have python.
Must have 'requests' python library.
Quick Start: When having API, open .py file and update the 'api_key' variable with your own API key then run as-is.
